@startuml
[*] --> Created : User creates account
Created --> Logged In : User logs in after creating account
Logged In --> Applied For Visa : User applies for visa after logging in
Applied For Visa --> Approved/Rejected : Application status is updated based on document check
Approved/Rejected --> Viewed Status : User views status of their application
Viewed Status --> Checked Status : User checks status of their application
Checked Status --> [*] : User logs out after checking status

Logged In --> Cancelled Application : User cancels application
Cancelled Application --> Logged In : User logs in to cancel application

Logged In --> Modified Details : User modifies details
Modified Details --> Viewed Details : User views details after modifying them
Viewed Details --> Given Feedback : User gives feedback after viewing details

Applied For Visa --> Approved/Rejected : Application status is updated based on document check
Approved/Rejected --> Completed Status Update : System updates status based on document check

[*] --> Applied For Visa : User applies for visa and payment is made
Applied For Visa --> Viewed Status : User views status of their application
Viewed Status --> Checked Status : User checks status of their application

@enduml
